sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant GUI
    participant System
    participant Database

    User ->> GUI: Open App/Login Page
    User ->> GUI: Enter Username & Password
    GUI ->> System: Validate Credentials
    System ->> Database: Check User Credentials
    alt Valid Login
        Database -->> System: User Found
        System -->> GUI: Grant Access & Show Dashboard
    else Invalid Login
        Database -->> System: User Not Found/Incorrect Password
        System -->> GUI: Show "Invalid Credentials"
    end

    alt User Chooses to Register Instead
        User ->> GUI: Clicks "Register"
        GUI ->> System: Show Registration Form
        User ->> GUI: Enter Details (Username, Email, Password)
        GUI ->> System: Validate Registration Data
        System ->> Database: Check for Duplicate Username/Email
        alt Username/Email Already Exists
            Database -->> System: Conflict Found
            System -->> GUI: Show "Username/Email Already Taken"
        else Unique Username/Email
            Database -->> System: Save New User
            System -->> GUI: Show "Registration Successful"
        end
    end

    alt User Wants to Reset Password
        User ->> GUI: Clicks "Forgot Password?"
        GUI ->> System: Request Password Reset
        System ->> Database: Check If Email Exists
        alt Email Exists
            Database -->> System: Send Reset Link
            System -->> GUI: Show "Password Reset Email Sent"
        else Email Not Found
            Database -->> System: Show "Email Not Registered"
        end
    end
